# Unit30
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit30核心词汇

portrait/ˈpɔːrtrɪt/肖像/She painted a portrait of her mother.
position/pəˈzɪʃn/位置；职位/He applied for the position of manager.
positive/ˈpɑːzətɪv/积极的/She always has a positive attitude toward life.
possess/pəˈzes/拥有/He possesses great musical talent.
possession/pəˈzeʃn/财产/She lost all her possessions in the fire.
possible/ˈpɑːsəbl/可能的/Is it possible to finish the work today?
post/poʊst/邮件；岗位/She got a new post at the university.
potential/pəˈtenʃl/潜力/He has the potential to become a great scientist.
pound/paʊnd/英镑；磅/The book costs ten pounds.
pour/pɔːr/倒/She poured some water into the glass.
poverty/ˈpɑːvərti/贫困/Many people still live in poverty.
power/ˈpaʊər/力量；权力/Knowledge is power.
practical/ˈpræktɪkl/实际的/We need practical solutions, not theories.
practice/ˈpræktɪs/实践/Practice makes perfect.
praise/preɪz/赞扬/He was praised for his excellent work.
pray/preɪ/祈祷/She prayed for her family's safety.
predict/prɪˈdɪkt/预测/It is difficult to predict the future.
prefer/prɪˈfɜːr/更喜欢/I prefer tea to coffee.
prepare/prɪˈper/准备/We need to prepare for the exam.
present/ˈpreznt/现在的；礼物/She gave me a beautiful present.
preserve/prɪˈzɜːrv/保护；保存/We must preserve our cultural heritage.
president/ˈprezɪdənt/总统；校长/He was elected president of the company.
press/pres/按；新闻界/Press the button to start the machine.
pressure/ˈpreʃər/压力/He is under a lot of work pressure.
pretend/prɪˈtend/假装/He pretended to be asleep when I came in.
pretty/ˈprɪti/漂亮的/She is a very pretty girl.
prevent/prɪˈvent/预防/We must take measures to prevent accidents.
previous/ˈpriːviəs/以前的/She had no previous experience in this field.
price/praɪs/价格/The price of oil has gone up significantly.
pride/praɪd/骄傲/She takes pride in her work.
primary/ˈpraɪmeri/主要的；初级的/Healthcare is a primary concern for everyone.
prime/praɪm/主要的；黄金期/He is in the prime of his life.
prince/prɪns/王子/The prince fell in love with a common girl.
principle/ˈprɪnsəpl/原则/He is a man of principle.
print/prɪnt/印刷/She printed the document for the meeting.
prior/ˈpraɪər/在先的/Prior to the meeting, please read the report.
priority/praɪˈɔːrəti/优先/Safety should be our top priority.
prison/ˈprɪzn/监狱/He was sent to prison for five years.
private/ˈpraɪvɪt/私人的/This is a private matter; please don't interfere.
privilege/ˈprɪvəlɪdʒ/特权/It is a privilege to work with such talented people.
prize/praɪz/奖品/She won first prize in the competition.
probable/ˈprɑːbəbl/可能的/The probable outcome is a victory for our team.
problem/ˈprɑːbləm/问题/We need to find a solution to this problem.
proceed/proˈsiːd/继续/Please proceed with the next step.
process/ˈprɑːses/过程/Learning is a lifelong process.
produce/prəˈduːs/生产/The factory produces 1000 cars a day.
product/ˈprɑːdʌkt/产品/The new product is very popular.
profession/prəˈfeʃn/职业/Medicine is a noble profession.
professional/prəˈfeʃənl/专业的/She is a professional photographer.
profit/ˈprɑːfɪt/利润/The company made a large profit last year.
